#### custom type examples

#### documents custom structs

- Verify: documents custom structs
   - Expected: dist equals `25`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 12 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-FEATURE-SDOCTEST-001
step("Verify: documents custom structs")
struct Point:
    x: i64
    y: i64

fn distance_from_origin(p: Point) -> i64:
    (p.x * p.x + p.y * p.y)

val p = Point(x: 3, y: 4)
val dist = distance_from_origin(p)
expect(dist).to_equal(25)
```

</details>

#### documents enums

- Verify: documents enums
   - Expected: is_active(Status.Active) is true
   - Expected: is_active(Status.Inactive) is false


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 16 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-FEATURE-SDOCTEST-001
step("Verify: documents enums")
enum Status:
    Active
    Inactive
    Pending

fn is_active(status: Status) -> bool:
    match status:
        Status.Active:
            true
        _:
            false

expect(is_active(Status.Active)).to_equal(true)
expect(is_active(Status.Inactive)).to_equal(false)
```

</details>

